@startuml US_3_2_3_Session
title US 3.2.3 - Manter sessão autenticada

actor User
participant SPA as "AuthService"
participant API as "AuthTestController\n/ authtest/me|logout"
database Store as "Browser storage\nlocalStorage auth_token\nuserAvatar"

SPA -> Store: carregar snapshot user
loop app start / rota protegida
  SPA -> API: GET /authtest/me (withCredentials, timeout 5s)
  alt cookie válido
    API --> SPA: profile + roles + access_token
    SPA -> Store: atualizar auth_token + avatar
  else expirado
    API --> SPA: 401
    SPA -> Store: limpar auth_token/avatar
    SPA -> User: redireciona /login
  end
end

User -> SPA: clique logout
SPA -> Store: limpar auth_token/avatar
SPA -> API: GET /authtest/logout
API --> User: redireciona frontend

@enduml
